<title>FRANCE: Four ships loading wheat in Rouen, two more due.</title>
<headline>Four ships loading wheat in Rouen, two more due.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four ships are loading a total of 82,000 tonnes of wheat at Rouen, port officials said on Monday.</p>
<p>The wheat is for export to the Canary Islands and Italy, they said.</p>
<p>Two more ships are expected in port by April 16 to load around 26,000 tonnes of wheat. The destination was not specified.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
